              "content": "// Package order 演示未被禁止的跨模块依赖默认允许。\npackage order\n\nimport \"example.test/shop/payment/api\"\n\n// Cancel 按订单关联的支付标识发起退款。\nfunc Cancel(paymentID string) error {\n\treturn api.RequestRefund(paymentID)\n}\n"
